# This machine has core.autocrlf=true. Without the rule below, shell scripts get
# committed with CRLF and the Linux VPS answers with:
#
#     bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M
#
# Silent on Windows, fatal on the server. Anything a container executes keeps LF.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
Caddyfile   text eol=lf
